{"id":"8406142550090","handle":"sequin-tulle-ruffle-sleeve-cocktail-dress-ec00404","title":"Sequin Tulle Ruffle Sleeve Cocktail Dress","descriptionHtml":"<p>Turn heads in this dazzling Sequin Tulle Ruffle Sleeve Cocktail Dress! Featuring shimmering sequins, playful tulle ruffle sleeves, and a figure-flattering silhouette, this dress is perfect for cocktail parties, weddings, or any glamorous evening event. Shine bright and make a statement!</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong><span>Tips: </span>High-stretch style; stretches at least 2 inches.</strong><br /><strong>Choose a size smaller for a snug fit.</strong><br /><strong>Prioritize bust measurement when selecting your size.</strong></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><b>Fit</b>: Please refer to size chart.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Length</b>: Maxi.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Sleeve Style</b>: Ruffle sleeve.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Closure</b>: Back zipper.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Undergarments</b>: Not padded, with lining.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Fabric</b>:The garment comprises tulle.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Stretch</b>: Fabric is high stretch.</p>\n<p><br /></p>","type":"Cocktail Dresses","tags":["Beaded","Cocktail Dresses","Dresses","Fall","Maxi","measure","New Arrivals","Ruffle Sleeve","Ruffled","Sequin","Sequin Dresses","Sheath","Short Sleeves","Spring","Summer","Tulle Dresses","V-Neck","Winters","With Sleeves"],"sourceUrl":"https://www.ever-pretty.com/products/sequin-tulle-ruffle-sleeve-cocktail-dress-ec00404","capturedAt":"2026-09-30T00:40:08.678Z","price":{"amount":159.99,"currency":"USD"},"compareAtPrice":null,"available":true,"options":["Color","Size"],"variants":[{"id":"44104868757578","sku":"EC00404KG04","color":"Antique Gold","size":"4","options":["Antique Gold","4"],"price":{"amount":159.99,"currency":"USD"},"compareAtPrice":null,"available":true,"image":"https://aj-nb.github.io/ever-pretty-media-1/media/optimized/26cff38723619dbb46e530c3f79f5bd744a654a677730dc5cbb48e33ff47395a-1280.webp","quantityRule":null,"titl